  "description": "Optional transport-agnostic control facade add-on for Orleans.Lattice whole-tree administration. Presents one discoverable, fail-closed surface for capabilities, shard diagnostics, storage and WAL usage, tree lifecycle, bulk load, resize, reshard, snapshots, restore, WAL placement, view administration, tag-index repair, retention, and schema-control delegation. Registered separately; adds no transport behaviour of its own.",
